# UPI payments

## Parse

Only `client/lib/upi/parse.ts`. Require `upi://pay` and `pa`. Reject `am=0` and out-of-range amounts. Keep table tests in `parse.test.ts`. Screens must not parse QR strings themselves.

## Handoff

`client/modules/upi-handoff`: Kotlin lists `upi://pay` apps and uses activity result; Swift opens URL and returns `unknown`. TS wrapper in `lib/native`. PIN stays in PhonePe/GPay/etc.

## Status

Returning from the UPI app is **not** SUCCESS unless Android extras say SUCCESS. Otherwise `returned` / `unknown` and the confirm sheet: Paid / Failed / Cancelled.

Copy: “Confirm in your UPI app.” Never a green check on return alone.

Transitions: only `server/src/services/paymentStatus.ts`. Debounce Pay with `PAY_DEBOUNCE_MS` (800).

No manual VPA screen in v1. Device proof: `docs/DEVICE_TEST.md` (not the emulator).
